### Part 3 — Machine Learning: Risk Prediction & Threshold Tuning (`03_model.ipynb`)

> [!TIP]
> **Highlighted Outputs Generated:**
> * **`test_risk_scores.csv`** — **198** test-set rows (`appointment_id`, `no_show`, `risk_prob`, `flag`) with **~49** bookings flagged at the **0.35** threshold.

* **Task 3.1 (Split & Baseline):** Built **11** features across **990** rows (`792` train / `198` test, `random_state=42`); test set contains **49** no-shows, giving a majority-class baseline accuracy of **0.7525** (149/198).
* **Task 3.2 (Logistic Regression & Odds Ratios):** Test accuracy **~0.788**, precision **~0.63**, recall **~0.35**, F1 **~0.45**, ROC-AUC **~0.789**. `reminder_sent` had the strongest negative coefficient (**~ -0.58**, SD **~0.49**): `np.exp(coef)` = **~0.56** (per 1 SD) vs. `np.exp(coef / scale)` = **~0.31** (**~69% lower odds** for `No → Yes`, holding other features constant).
* **Tasks 3.3 & 3.4 (Model Benchmarks):**

| Model | Train Accuracy | Test Accuracy | Test Recall | Test ROC-AUC |
|---|---:|---:|---:|---:|
| **Logistic Regression** | — | **~0.788** | **~0.35** | **~0.789** |
| **Decision Tree (full depth ~15)** | 1.000 | ~0.670 | — | — |
| **Decision Tree (`max_depth=3`)** | ~0.820 | ~0.780 | — | — |
| **Random Forest (100 trees)** | 1.000 | ~0.750 | ~0.31 | ~0.710 |

* **Task 3.5 (Training-Only CV Selection & Threshold Calibration):**
  * **5-Fold CV ROC-AUC (Train Only):** Logistic Regression `Pipeline` (**~0.77**) ≥ Tuned Random Forest (**~0.77**) > Default Random Forest (**~0.75**) > Depth-3 Tree (**~0.68**).
  * **Out-of-Fold Threshold Choice:** `0.35` (Precision **~0.51**, Recall **~0.47**, F1 **~0.49**, **~154** flagged) beat `0.50` (Precision **~0.58**, Recall **~0.25**, F1 **~0.35**, **~73** flagged).
  * **Single Test-Set Evaluation (`threshold = 0.35`):** Precision **~0.57**, Recall **~0.57**, **~49** flagged out of 198, ROC-AUC **~0.79**.

